id: lagged
name: Lagged
kind: condition
maxStacks: 1
# Not one of the published Combat Conditions: a status of its own (Time Lag's "becomes Lagged").
combatCondition: no
description: >
  Thrust outside the flow of time by Time Lag: Strike and Dodge Rolls 2(T) lower (its Slowed a stack of its own).
text: >
  A Lagged Opponent has their Strike and Dodge Rolls reduced by 2(T) and suffers from a stack of the Slowed Combat Condition.

---

[passive]
strike -= 2(T);
dodge -= 2(T);
